  "description": "Family-owned and operated, Think Outside is the premier retailer of fine patio furniture and accessories on the Alabama Gulf Coast. We offer comfortable, stylish, durable patio & balcony furniture and outdoor accessories so you can enjoy resort-style relaxation at home. At Think Outside, we believe that life is best lived outdoors, and we'd love to help you breathe the fresh air more often. We specialize in outdoor elegance and are well-equipped to design a relaxing open-air environment that appeals to your tastes. We have more than 50 years of retail experience, and we offer design and decorating consultations to help you envision and execute the look you'll love. Visit us to shop our stellar showroom. Among our curated inventory, you'll find the best brands, diverse designs, and pieces that are just as beautiful as they are durable. Delivery is free to the local community, and many of our lines will drop ship throughout the continental U.S. Let us outfit your balcony, patio or porch with high-end items that are suited to our Coastal conditions. When you're ready to turn your dream outdoor retreat into a reality, just Think Outside.",
